          "en": "whether you need to set some other setting there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 487.71,
          "end": 491.19,
          "en": "to build your Angular application the way you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 491.19,
          "end": 494.46,
          "en": "And last but not least, we have the tslint.json file here.",
